# FocalTech FT8201 touchscreen driver

config TOUCHSCREEN_MTK_FT8201
	bool "FocalTech FT8201 touchscreen"
	help
	  Say Y here for the FocalTech FT8201 controller on the Lenovo
	  TB-X606F. This driver supports touch reporting, gestures and
	  controller firmware loading through the MediaTek touch framework.

	  If unsure, say N.
